      "description": "Styrka is a clean, no-nonsense workout tracker built for people who just want to log their lifts and get back to training.\n\nMost workout apps are filled with subscriptions, social features, and unnecessary complexity. Styrka is different.\n\nStyrka is a fast, minimalist gym tracker designed to help you log workouts in seconds, track your progress, and stay consistent. Whether you're following Push Pull Legs, Upper/Lower, Full Body, or your own routine, Styrka keeps the focus on training—not on the app.\n\nTRACK EVERY WORKOUT\nLog your sets, reps, weight, RPE/RIR, rest times, and notes with an interface designed to stay out of your way.\n• Over 100 built-in exercises\n• Create unlimited custom exercises\n• Bodyweight exercises like Pull-Ups and Dips\n• Timed exercises like Planks and Running\n• Edit workouts anytime\n• Track unilateral exercises separately\n• Workout streaks and training history\n\nTRAIN SMARTER\nProgressive overload is easier when your previous workouts are always available.\n• Automatically pre-filled sets from your latest workout\n• Smart weight progression suggestions\n• Personal records\n• Workout templates\n• Custom progression settings\n• Repeat recent workouts\n• Weekly and monthly insights\n\nSEE YOUR PROGRESS\nVisualize your strength improvements over time.\n• Exercise progress charts\n• Weekly training volume\n• Most improved exercises\n• Body weight tracking\n• Goal weight tracking\n• Training statistics and trends\n\nAPPLE WATCH & APPLE HEALTH\nTake your workouts with you.\n• Log workouts directly from Apple Watch\n• Live Activities & Dynamic Island rest timer\n• Sync workouts to Apple Health\n• Count workouts toward your Activity Rings\n• Automatic iCloud sync across devices\n\nDESIGNED TO STAY OUT OF YOUR WAY\nNo account.\nNo subscriptions.\nNo ads.\nNo unnecessary features.\nYour workout data stays on your device and syncs securely through iCloud.\n\nOpen the app, start lifting, and get back to training.\n\nBuilt by someone who lifts.",
